eceived_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"assigned","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2014-11-25T19:15:06Z","assignee":{"login":"markstory","id":24086,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MDg2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24086?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory","html_url":"https://github.com/markstory","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markstory/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/64457934","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/5257#issuecomment-64457934","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/5257","id":64457934,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY0NDU3OTM0","user":{"login":"sdustinh","id":2855100,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NTUxMDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2855100?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh","html_url":"https://github.com/sdustinh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-11-25T19:38:12Z","updated_at":"2014-11-25T19:38:12Z","body":"The `Devices.DeviceInformations` was just me being lazy for `'associated' => ['Devices' => ['associated' => ['DeviceInformations']]]`.\n\nThe `$include` is correct, I believe:\n\n``` php\n$include = [\n    'Racks' => [\n        'associated' => [\n            'Devices' => [\n                'associated' => ['DeviceInformations']\n            ]\n        ]\n    ]\n];\n```\n\nI think the reason that `DeviceInformations` was not saving even when `Devices` was is because I had `$options['atomic'] = false;` and was not saving the device information manually. The strange part is that even with `atomic` set to `true` and `$this->Racks->save($Rack, $options)` called it will return `false`. I created a `beforeSave()` on my `DevicesTable`, `DeviceInformationsTable` and `RacksTable` but none of them were called so I know it's failing on the validation. When I turn validation off it will save only Racks and Devices. I don't have any validation set on these tables.\n\nThe more I've poked around on it and sifted through source the more I think the only issue here is the `$map` variable. The rest is probably just user error. :smirk: \n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/64457934/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"sdustinh","id":2855100,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NTUxMDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2855100?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh","html_url":"https://github.com/sdustinh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/64459657","html_url":"https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/issues/5257#issuecomment-64459657","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/5257","id":64459657,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY0NDU5NjU3","user":{"login":"sdustinh","id":2855100,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NTUxMDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2855100?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh","html_url":"https://github.com/sdustinh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-11-25T19:49:29Z","updated_at":"2014-11-25T19:49:29Z","body":"Actually, it looks like this is the problem...\n\n``` php\n// RacksController::add();\npublic function add() {\n\n    $data = $this->request->data();\n    $rack = $this->Racks->newEntity($data);\n\n    if ($this->request->is('post')) {\n        if ($this->Racks->addRack($rack)) {\n            return $this->redirect([\n                'action' => 'view',\n                $rack->get('id')\n            ]);\n        }\n    }\n\n    $this->set([\n        'rack' => $rack\n    ]);\n\n}\n\n// RacksTable::addRack();\npublic function addRack($Rack, array $options = []) {\n\n    $options += [\n        'associated' => [\n            'Devices' => [\n                'associated' => ['DeviceInformations']\n            ]\n        ]\n    ];\n\n    if (is_array($Rack)) {\n        $Rack = $this->newEntity($Rack, $options);\n    }\n\n    return $this->save($Rack, $options);\n\n}\n```\n\nOn the controller I was passing the entity but the entity was created without a deeper association so the `DeviceInformations` data wasn't being converted to an entity. It was saving the device properly but even though it was told to save the information association it was being ignored. Once I passed in `$data` instead of the entity it saved perfectly. I guess I'll need to update my `addRack()` method.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/64459657/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"sdustinh","id":2855100,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NTUxMDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2855100?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh","html_url":"https://github.com/sdustinh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sdustinh